<title>UK: Vibroplant appoints finance director.</title>
<headline>Vibroplant appoints finance director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British plant hire firm Vibroplant Plc said on Monday it had appointed Neil Stothard as finance director with effect from July 7.  </p>
<p>Stothard is currently finance director at Gray Dawes Group Ltd.</p>
<p>The firm announced in March that finance director Eric Woolley would be leaving the company.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
